{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43605","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 招国坊崇济寺 奇松联二十字绝句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 招国坊崇济寺 奇松联二十字绝句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杉松何相疎，榆柳方迥屑。\n无人擅谈柄，一枝不敢折。\n中庭苔藓深，吹余鸣佛禽。\n至於摧折枝，凡草犹避阴。\n僻径根从露，闲房枝任侵。\n一株风正好，来助碧云吟。\n时时埽窗声，重露滴寒砌。\n风颭一枝遒，闲窥别生势。\n偃盖入楼妨，盘根侵井窄。\n高僧独惆怅，爲与澄岚隔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}